{"id":"vod_sn_38848","vodId":"38848","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"你还是不懂群马","name_cn":"你还是不懂群马","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/838c66e19bfba94ebb258e770624abdd.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《你还是不懂群马》改编自井田ヒロト著同名搞笑漫画，于2018年2月宣布动画化，由旭 Production负责动画制作。2018年4月2日起，每周一群马电视台首播。神月纪原先是生活在千叶县，但家里要搬家到群马县，得知神月纪要搬家到群马生活居住，青梅竹马警告他，去了群马是不会活着回来的。于是神月纪在网上调查了群马的资料，净是发现了很多负面的信息。在进入群马县的高中后作为外来者，神月纪与过于热爱群马县的当地学生学习了很多群马本地的特色文化和本地的一些梗（虽然具体过程比较暴力比较颜艺），同时还卷入了群马县和千叶县的地域战争当中——","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:05:07","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jxcBkN2e431/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7kk7DBQ8PT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UDnyt6K8BF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nQsid6DzDf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SLcrXyXEzh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8HNG6jRqxi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/miSFqF9XAs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XTb4GUrXbv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XpsXEGrzPN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9bWG68p8SG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pY5fPRTtMx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4dN1fL8M3p1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:53.904Z"}